{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"c5764730f980c2891863c25018174737cc065ad9fcf7c0af7871d1579c7c8f0d","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"abd63bcda191f04ae4773bbd80a781a2339d3198a0ee57f6995c4848e19dfc4d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ad112fac44e7b1a93a7982695be174e005c9d4dcc850e132a398f543daa26ebe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:713 原文 'endure until the final blow is struck against the arcane' 指坚持到对奥术给出最后一击（即彻底击败奥术），译文「愿意抵抗奥术力量的侵袭直到最后」改成了被动防守奥术侵袭，主客关系变了；同句 'batter a mage senseless' 也漏译了「打晕」这一因果，而正是打晕让法师无法施法。"},{"revision_key":"aef80f759dc3430f7fe2f0691a971321792669fbfd2c1a6fdb1ad8ea3a7e0833","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af134601b9094b08b427165c6d352f143842714e3314ba7f5039fa657774bc58","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af638be305dbb28ac6bb5182ed22d77a3105d13a25ddb9c79ed112c79b604b65","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af7e44f24139de271241126bad6473b2092a0ecdf14aaa97612c5b6f0f7efe22","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"af936fa4199e59e9e85da15612ceef980adba0882d0cb0198ab5121097aeeb27","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/zones.lua:78（cults-maggot-1）原文 'By feeding it a special artifact, we shall be able to open a portal' 是尚未执行的计划（shall，后接 May it taste…），译文「我们故意喂给它了…这打开了…传送门」写成已完成，事件时序变了。另外 'the dark ones squirming in the void' 指虚空中蠕动的黑暗存在，被译成「黑暗能量」；'after our long seclusion' 被译成转折「尽管我们长期隐居」，句间关系有误。"},{"revision_key":"afbbe9c100bc5d0f95d3375aaf17244bc08586e36284a73a541b00f35fde2977","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/zones.lua:59-61（cults-entropic-void）原文只说 antropic force 是 'the only thing which can defeat entropy'，译文「战胜熵魔」把熵拟人化成原文没有的「熵魔」；'something in here with you' 被译成「有一种东西正支配着这里」，凭空加了支配关系；复数 'small patches of light' 被译成单数「一束虚弱的微光」，还多加了原文没有的「虚弱」。"},{"revision_key":"b08026ed7510e49a1705fcef49b9646c89cf29c5df93a9c7722b37f89ccaf742","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"races.lua:76 原文计数条件是 'for each bleeding creature in radius 2'，没有可见性要求；译文「2 格范围内每个可见的流着黑血的生物」加了「可见」这一限制条件（'sight of the black blood' 只是修辞）。envelope 未提供该 talent 回调源码，无法证明实现有视线判定，按原文应删去「可见」，或补源码证据后再定。"},{"revision_key":"b113df39861cf1b7838033294d9e5c3348bcec4e9cf0e87c3da15a46812a32a5","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"lore/misc.lua:110-118（races-krog）有多处语义错误：①'answering the call to do battle with a rogue mage' 中 rogue 修饰法师（叛逃/失控法师），译文「独自和法师战斗」错把它当成克罗格独自行动；②'mixing infusions, producing the majority of what one might find in the markets' 指市面上大部分纹身出自他们之手，译文「生产大部分在大陆市场上可以找到的东西」扩大成所有商品；③'rather successful as evidenced by the creation of the many artistic works' 讲的是重塑形象获得成功，译文「证明了自己独立的地位」凭空加了「独立地位」；④「天生的符文」多加了原文没有的「天生」，原文也未说食人魔符文是天生的。"},{"revision_key":"b13bdfbdbb35e5c64b385e602f45cf84c5c0653fbff489f3e17a0a3d04ce7973","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"misc.lua:108 原文要求 'out of sight of any other creature when you cast it and when the teleportation takes effect'，也就是施放时和生效时这两个时点；译文「在此期间你需要处于任何生物视线外」变成了整个 40 回合都要持续满足，条件写严了。envelope 未提供 EFF_TELEPORT_KROSHKKUR 的检查实现，至少应按原文写明两个时点。"},{"revision_key":"b2fcb23014b19e4b7f4ef71e68771d345537068a5413cc80d28934cf819551b4","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b34f537d1fe13610dd03a2def061b40fc5e80b6f2c4592d46ab3cbef334ba420","verdict":"OK"}]}